/**
 * get_platform_facts — the chat agent's LIVE source for policy/platform facts.
 *
 * The 2026-10 audit (/root/agent-notes/ai-responses/AUDIT.md) traced most of
 * the bot's factual errors to a static prompt that had drifted from the code:
 *   - "every VPS includes a dedicated IPv4" — false; a VPS gets one only when a
 *     pool address is free in its region, otherwise it's on shared NAT with
 *     port forwards, and the paid add-on is an admin-priced setting;
 *   - "don't quote a region" / "no per-region selection" — false; Singapore,
 *     Canada and Germany are picked in the deploy wizard;
 *   - "I don't see a 30-day money-back guarantee" — the real policy is the
 *     72-hour first-order guarantee in lib/refund-policy.ts;
 *   - "cards via Stripe" only — PayPal is live too;
